Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:43.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, um, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I made a decision kind of around that time to like just basically remove everything on my plate just spend time on like product engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I do a few things like you're like the uh you're the first person that's actually seen the whole office like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:21:55.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't do a lot of these and I uh I love your show,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's like great to have you here and kind of give a sneak peek to the world on like what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:02.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, um, and then the rest of my time's on like how do I like work on product engineering?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:08.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do I advance the humanoid to do better things?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.91,0:22:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or how do I make covers system out to the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.81,0:22:13.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to start testing it and getting feedback.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And how do we get heart models and devices out to the world to scale?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like those are the things I think really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Matters less about like doing traditional PR and event, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:27.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,like going to like trade shows and, you know, um, sitting on like these like panels and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,None of this matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.96,0:22:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:30.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.56,0:22:34.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh so I try to spend my time in the bullpen and then I try to like
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.31,0:22:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,maximize my time both when I'm in or out of the office on things that are important.
