Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,You mentioned a bit of inspiration on ideas around coming from Shopify, but on the leadership standpoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,like who are people that you admire or have looked up to that like help carry you forward and keep you motivated?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.76,0:24:45.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was I I mean, kind of like a generation behind like Steve Jobs and that whole, you know, uh crew, like Jeff Bezos,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.11,0:24:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is a big investor for us at Figure, and you know, I get I get to basically have access to and talk with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.08,0:24:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And um you know, for me, like I want to play the game like 11 out of 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.96,0:24:57.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to go really hard at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.94,0:24:59.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like so we're really serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:00.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty competitive person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.74,0:25:06.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,So if I'm going to do this and like sacrifice my life to do this and my time, I I I just want to nail it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.42,0:25:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to win and I want to do uh I want to do everything to the most hardcore level possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.89,0:25:16.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And um so I think the folks I looked up to in the world are the folks that have done that, have been successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,but have like really devoted their time to being um kind of best athlete in those situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:25.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um So uh yeah, and I'm looking at myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.27,0:25:26.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like how do I make these companies work?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.63,0:25:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's just nothing worse than like 10, 15, 20 years from now these things not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.40,0:25:34.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like what I I should I like I missed all my golf trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I missed like time with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.36,0:25:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just like I just missed all this stuff in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I at this point I have plenty of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.76,0:25:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's like I'm doing this because I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.49,0:25:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I better be getting better at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.73,0:25:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you know, recursively improving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.61,0:25:52.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think I look up to the folks like that that have done that through their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.15,0:25:58.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you look at like Steve and Jeff and some of these group groups are kind of a generation above me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.13,0:26:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,They they've been good at many things in their life across many different areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.48,0:26:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And um they've also too devoted their life to doing this and have been like a good source of inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:10.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and it's been hard and they've done it over decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.32,0:26:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This stuff is like not This stuff doesn't happen overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been work I've been doing like 20 years now doing all this stuff and I feel like I'm just starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are the biggest risks to the business?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The humanoid thing is just so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.12,0:26:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I can't like even explain it very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's uh getting the robots to do the things we showed you today has been like it has almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.76,0:26:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have such an uphill battle to go do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.44,0:26:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same with Archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.41,0:26:43.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to fly aircraft every day above cities and make it really safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.38,0:26:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's like one of the safest forms of transportation you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.52,0:26:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this this stuff I'm working through is just like um like if you look at the odds of it of of these things,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.36,0:26:57.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, working they're like super low.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.12,0:26:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think that's probably pretty accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, um I basically have like a I basically have a funnel of the hardest, most pernicious problems I have to go solve every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.40,0:27:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're like they're really really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.37,0:27:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am So, like my biggest risk, there's like a list of risk list like s- a very long list of risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And things that could hurt like things that could like make us to not make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:29.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um the figure, the most important thing is to be able to do end-to-end useful work over a long time horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.80,0:27:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to be able to put a robot into a home and be able to do like 7 to 10 hours of work successfully without failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.12,0:27:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,With to know with no human intervention and then do that every day forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just like a hard problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.17,0:27:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nobody's ever shown that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.20,0:27:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The robot's very complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.16,0:27:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's like designing like a turbofan or a rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.32,0:27:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like an aircraft from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:55.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just like a very difficult thing that we've also designed the entire supply chain from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, it's like it's got a ton of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:27:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, it doesn't work the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:00.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working those problems out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.83,0:28:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like we used to run that robot here, figure figure one, and man that robot could like run for like an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it would like fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.76,0:28:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know all the reasons why it would fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.92,0:28:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or it would like, you know, lose power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.32,0:28:15.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you know, we moved to figure two.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.11,0:28:18.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think we probably like maybe we saw that like once a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.88,0:28:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now figure three like I think, you know, everywhere here they're all running all all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.00,0:28:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we see faults we'll see faults every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.56,0:28:29.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not on every single robot, but we'll see faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.80,0:28:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have a list of those and we're working those down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.00,0:28:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um but it's really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as we're growing the fleet, the absolute number of faults are rising and we got to go figure out how to solve those.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:41.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cuz like you said before like the amount of states the robot can be in is so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.64,0:28:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you can't really reasonably predict what the robot's going to like look like at every single time stamp everywhere in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.36,0:28:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You kind of can for a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.73,0:28:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's like kind of you can just drive on roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.48,0:28:53.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,You It's a hard problem, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.99,0:28:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, like um anyway, I think what I'm trying to say is like we have like a funhouse of problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.41,0:29:02.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it's like never-ending problem city for the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.02,0:29:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um we have to be able to manufacture unprecedented rates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.04,0:29:08.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to get humanoid robots to work autonomously without human intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.49,0:29:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nobody's ever shown that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.36,0:29:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to make it work with like a AI policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.04,0:29:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The hardware can't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.92,0:29:13.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's got to be really affordable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.02,0:29:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've got to make a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.48,0:29:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we've got to get consumers to want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.64,0:29:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.76,0:29:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you've raised nearly $2 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.64,0:29:28.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think most recently publicly stated at $39 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.82,0:29:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you see capital as a risk or a constraint or the valuation as a risk or This will build like the biggest business in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.51,0:29:40.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like half of like little under half of GDP is human labor in the commercial market.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.51,0:29:42.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like they pay wages for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.59,0:29:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We We do human work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you're looking at we will have the ability to ship, if the robots work well, billions of robots in the commercial workforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:53.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh you'll produce you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.63,0:30:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's like 30 trillion 40 trillion of wages paid to this like every year to that to like to to for to folks that'd be doing that work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:08.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to expand that work, automate more like a lot of it, and to continue to scale it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.28,0:30:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think like that, plus the stuff we're seeing in the home, will just build like enormous of tens of trillions of revenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.16,0:30:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll build something massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.36,0:30:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, what do most companies trade at?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.16,0:30:22.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tech companies trade at 10 or 20 times revenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're in like 10 trillion dollars or you know, whatever, 100 billion dollars to trillion dollars of revs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.52,0:30:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like this is going to be a huge business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.92,0:30:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you have plans for the moon or Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'd love to send robots into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.04,0:30:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's get them out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.20,0:30:41.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.88,0:30:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.96,0:30:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.48,0:30:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I do. it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.40,0:30:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have some figure robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.64,0:30:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have some figure swag.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.48,0:30:50.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, so yeah, some hats, shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.68,0:30:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can rep the Figure brand here. is a lot of merch. of merch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.04,0:30:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm going to have to get a new closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.08,0:30:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.53,0:31:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was funny, I don't think they caught this when we were recording the the the tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.52,0:31:10.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I asked you how you made the logo and you said it was uh the robot steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.24,0:31:12.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it basically the robot takes footsteps like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.06,0:31:14.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even in simulation they look like little squares.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.48,0:31:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh so you have like a little uh like kind of a walk a walk and then you also have a little a kind of an F abstract F.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.32,0:31:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.08,0:31:25.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll keep the walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.56,0:31:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.99,0:31:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, as we wrap up, what are you most looking forward to for this next year?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.24,0:31:37.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um Uh for this year I want to ship robots at scale out to the world and second thing I want to solve
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.35,0:31:42.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,is I want to solve There's like um we have like an extreme focus here to solve like what I call general robotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.80,0:31:44.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like a robot that can do everything a human can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.25,0:31:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have like almost like a feeling of like a human in a body suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.09,0:31:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can talk to, can look at you, reason,
